{"schema_version":"1.8.0","id":"PSF-2026-34","published":"2026-07-28T13:46:30.650Z","modified":"2026-08-11T03:45:04.057354215Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-6879"],"details":"`Element.findall()` and fully-consumed `Element.iterfind()` exhibit `O(n^2)` time complexity when using XPath index predicates (e.g. `[1]`, `[last()]`, `[last()-N]`) on XML documents with many same-tag siblings. `Element.find()` is only affected when the first match is near the end  of the sibling list, such as with `[last()]` or `[last()-N]`;  `.//item[1]` short-circuits after the first match.","affected":[{"ranges":[{"type":"GIT","repo":"https://github.com/python/cpython","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2ffab083782968a4d732738f4f1dff6bbd69d2b0"},{"fixed":"02c08e6b747ac43d0d866a4ffa916bedf3423f81"},{"fixed":"390337b8ba1658833fdef379e1739c9f9533a8db"},{"fixed":"cb409342a19f25656f62e679f8bac265fe1442c3"},{"fixed":"96510a3758f4a075f43223afdee3b6ee1a7a7f02"},{"fixed":"037965c00a427cba5c05447efadc67c51a492e85"},{"fixed":"0583f24ae678993e3f7939f51ad5bcae5ad9dc70"}]}],"versions":["v3.15.0b4","v3.15.0b3","v3.13.14","v3.14.6","v3.15.0b2","v3.14.5","v3.15.0b1","v3.14.5rc1","v3.13.13","v3.14.4","v3.15.0a8","v3.15.0a7","v3.12.13","v3.10.20","v3.11.15","v3.15.0a6","v3.13.12","v3.14.3","v3.15.0a5","v3.15.0a4","v3.15.0a3","v3.14.2","v3.13.11","v3.13.10","v3.14.1","v3.15.0a2","v3.15.0a1","v3.13.8","v3.11.14","v3.10.19","v3.12.12","v3.14.0","v3.14.0rc3","v3.13.7","v3.14.0rc2","v3.13.6","v3.14.0rc1","v3.14.0b4","v3.14.0b3","v3.13.5","v3.13.4","v3.11.13","v3.10.18","v3.12.11","v3.14.0b2","v3.14.0b1","v3.13.3","v3.11.12","v3.12.10","v3.14.0a7","v3.10.17","v3.14.0a6","v3.14.0a5","v3.13.2","v3.12.9","v3.14.0a4","v3.14.0a3","v3.13.1","v3.12.8","v3.10.16","v3.11.11","v3.14.0a2","v3.14.0a1","v3.13.0","v3.13.0rc3","v3.12.7","v3.11.10","v3.10.15","v3.13.0rc2","v3.12.6","v3.12.5","v3.13.0rc1","v3.13.0b4","v3.13.0b3","v3.12.4","v3.13.0b2","v3.13.0b1","v3.13.0a6","v3.12.3","v3.11.9","v3.10.14","v3.13.0a5","v3.13.0a4","v3.12